# pi-gen export marker.
#
# The presence of this file makes pi-gen export a deployable image artifact for
# the stage-droplet stage (pi-gen convention: a stage with EXPORT_IMAGE /
# EXPORT_NOOBS produces an image under deploy/). The contents set the exported
# image suffix and default compression — kept consistent with image/config
# (DEPLOY_COMPRESSION=gz).
IMG_SUFFIX="-droplet-appliance"
